OL,3,GNEWSAThe man who would be king - the
OL,4,Arise and fall of 'the next Prince
OL,5,ANaseem'
OL,6,
OL,7,FBoxer Daniel Teasdale was hailed as the
OL,8,Fheir to the legendary Prince Naseem
OL,9,FHamed, but his promise never
OL,10,Fmaterialised into fame, fortune and
OL,11,Ffilms.
OL,13,F"He's better than Naz at the same age,"
OL,14,Fsaid trainer Brendan Ingle.
OL,16,FHamed had won his first world title
OL,17,Faged 21. Teasdale was still a teenager.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
