OL,3,GNEWSAThe man who would be king - the
OL,4,Arise and fall of 'the next Prince
OL,5,ANaseem'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIngle, from his gym in Sheffield,
OL,8,Fmoulded the careers of a conveyor belt
OL,9,Fof world-beaters and title winners. He
OL,10,Fguided both of the fighters from
OL,11,Fchildhood.
